  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Country programme framework for Costa Rica for inclusive and sustainable industrial development (2024-2028)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching objective of this Country Programme Framework is to support the Government of Costa Rica in attaining the goals to a ccelerate the economic growth of the country set out in the National Strategic Plan 2050  and the National Development and Public Investment Plan 2022-2026 . Through the Country Programme Framework, UNIDO will deliver its resources in an integrated manner based on its comparative advantages towards Costa Rica#s industrial objectives and targets. UNIDO will achieve this goal by operating its technical cooperation function, and, particularly, by emphasizing its ability to support the Government at policy, normative, and convening level. Under the Government#s leadership and ownership, all relevant parties # national and international counterparts # will work in a multi-stakeholder partnership towards the mobilization of the necessary resources and the implementation of technical activities in full alignment with national industrial priorities</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org role="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regular Programme Of Technical Cooperati</narrative>
  </participating-org>
